OL,4,BPremier League clubs to cover legal    
OL,5,Bcosts if Man City sponsors sue         
OL,6,GPremier League clubs have voted to     
OL,7,Gcover legal expenses for the           
OL,8,Gorganisation's five board directors if 
OL,9,Gany of Manchester City's sponsors sue  
OL,10,Gthem.                                  
OL,12,FThe clubs met in London on Thursday    
OL,13,Ffor the first time since City were     
OL,14,Ffound guilty of a catalogue of charges 
OL,15,Frelating to the breaching of the       
OL,16,Fleague's financial rules by an         
OL,17,Findependent commission in September.   
OL,19,FCity have appealed and maintain their  
OL,20,Finnocence, with a sanction yet to be   
OL,21,Fdecided.                               
